    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d741">

                <pb facs="0678" n="562" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg562"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 815.51/180.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-01-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 31, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Honduran Congress rejected the Loan Convention to-day, 33 to 5.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McCreery.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
